        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1723885615f94654b2b0c134fd6c2ebf",
      "statement": "The Google OAuth apply enables the provider and supplies both credentials in a single write, rather than enabling it alone, because a service with OAuth enabled and no credentials is worse than no button: the rendered button leads to a redirect the service answers with an error, whereas with the feature off no OAuth traffic exists at all.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L149-L190",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:787953242686af4dc554d09ed5c529dfff97b9afd871bcc157fa8211a9af770f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2e2f2ebba9ee4d3f8fc376863d1bb33c",
      "statement": "The Google OAuth redirect URI registered in the Google Cloud console is https://<srvId>.ulabase.app/auth/oauth/callback/google, hosted on the service domain because the service performs the token exchange and the app never receives the authorization code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L64-L74",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:36e2c939cc6faf9c6a8719367ad450099cd1bfc3bea5dded9f32cd84ed66e43f:"
        }
      ]
    },
